# Used instead of the root .dockerignore when building frontend/Dockerfile (BuildKit
# reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore). The build needs the root package manifests,
# packages/semantic-types and frontend/; nothing else is sent.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!packages/semantic-types
!frontend
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
frontend/e2e
frontend/Dockerfile*
